John Malkovich and S low Horses star Rosalind Eleazar will hit the West End stage this summer in a new play by Rebecca Reid to be directed by Matthew Dunster ( Hangmen, The Hunger Games ).

History will play a strictly limited run at Wyndham's Theatre from May 17 to August 7, 2027.

Produced by Fiery Angel and Kater Gordon, History , Reid's West End debut, is, according to its synopsis, &#8220;about the stories we tell and who gets to tell them.&#8221;

&#8220;Wren used to have a vibrant, creative life,&#8221; the synopsis continues. &#8220;Then came the baby, the sleepless nights, the doomscrolling. She does something reckless: she calls James, the ex who once defined her, and invites him to lunch only to discover that the story she thought was finished is still being written.&#8221; blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article1-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid","mid-articleX","mid-article","300x251"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[2,2],[300,250],[620,350],[300,251],[501,282],[3,3],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366]]) .exemptFromSleep() .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; }); Related Stories Festivals Santa Barbara Film Festival Awards: Anne Hathaway Set For American Riviera Honor News 'Paddington The Musical' Extends London West End Run Through June 2028

